\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textsc  {BindCheck}{} architecture. A skill procedure drives the LLM through explicit ledgers (top). Deterministic analysis tools answer factual queries (bottom), and a per-stack knowledge base informs the statement ledger. For each warning, an exploration loop writes attack tests, runs them in a sandbox (local chain, the project's own prover), and attaches the paths tried and any executed test. Humans adjudicate the package; no LLM verdict serves as ground truth.}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{3}{7}{\tool {} architecture. A skill procedure drives the LLM through explicit ledgers (top). Deterministic analysis tools answer factual queries (bottom), and a per-stack knowledge base informs the statement ledger. For each warning, an exploration loop writes attack tests, runs them in a sandbox (local chain, the project's own prover), and attaches the paths tried and any executed test. Humans adjudicate the package; no LLM verdict serves as ground truth}{figure.3}{}}
